    <item>
      <title>Threat Modelling</title>
      <link>/posts/threat-modelling/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>/posts/threat-modelling/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;methologies&#34;&gt;Methologies&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://threat-modeling.com/pasta-threat-modeling/&#34;&gt;PASTA - Process for Attack Simulation and Threat Analysis&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;Focuses on aligning considerations of business objectives with technical requirements.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/STRIDE_model&#34;&gt;STRIDE - Spoofing, Tampering, Repudiation, Information Disclosure, DoS, Elevation&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;Focuses on identifying what can fail in the system being modelled.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://owasp.org/www-community/Threat_Modeling&#34;&gt;OWASP - Open Web Application Security Project&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;Focuses on identifying possible threats, prioritizing risks, and planning mitigation strategies. It is mainly used with web and desktop applications.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Determine assessment scope&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Identify threat agents.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Identify potential attacks.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Identify exploitable vulnerabilities.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Prioritize identified risks.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Mitigate risks.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
    </item>
